DESCRIPTION:PRELIMINARY PRINT \nVolume 608 U. S. Part 2 \nPages 531–554 
 \nOFFICIAL REPORTS \nOF \nTHE SUPREME COURT \nJune 4\, 2026 \nREBECCA A. W
 OMELDORF \nreporter of decisions \nPage Proof Pending Publication\nNOTICE:
